OL,3,CMan in his 40s dies after road
OL,4,Ccollision in Co Tyrone
OL,6,FA man has died after a crash involving
OL,7,Fa car and a lorry in Clogher, Co
OL,8,FTyrone.
OL,10,FInspector Stewart from the Police
OL,11,FService's Collision Investigation Unit
OL,12,Fsaid: "We received a report at
OL,13,Fapproximately 12.40pm on Friday
OL,14,Fafternoon, 31st July, of a collision
OL,15,Finvolving a white MG HS car and a
OL,16,FVolvo lorry on the Crossowen Road.
OL,18,F"Officers attended, alongside Northern
OL,19,FIreland Ambulance Service colleagues `
OL,20,Fand medical treatment was provided at
OL,21,Fthe scene to a number of people.
