OL,3,CMan in his 40s dies after road
OL,4,Ccollision in Co Tyrone
OL,6,F"The man, aged in his 40s, sadly died
OL,7,Ffrom his injuries a short time later.
OL,9,F"We would like to hear from witnesses
OL,10,For anyone who may have captured dash-
OL,11,Fcam or other footage which could
OL,12,Fassist with our ongoing enquiries."
